1
00:00:00,388 --> 00:00:04,428
(Raj:)if you hadn't been
my role model.

2
00:00:04,425 --> 00:00:08,065
(Raj:)Who wants to go to Vegas
in a real helicopter?!

3
00:00:11,698 --> 00:00:13,838
(Leonard(on screen):)It was L. Frank Baum who said,

4
00:00:13,835 --> 00:00:19,005
"No thief, however skillful,
can rob one of knowledge,

5
00:00:19,007 --> 00:00:24,077
(Leonard(on screen):)and that is why knowledge is
the best and safest treasure."

6
00:00:24,078 --> 00:00:27,378
(Leonard(on screen):)Wow, I'm boring myself.

7
00:00:27,382 --> 00:00:29,212
(sighs)

8
00:00:29,217 --> 00:00:31,717
(Leonard(on screen):)Sorry, I can't see
any of your faces right now,

9
00:00:31,719 --> 00:00:33,649
(Leonard(on screen):)but I bet they look like this.

10
00:00:38,191 --> 00:00:42,291
(Leonard(on screen):)Uh, you know,
I-I wrote an entire speech

11
00:00:42,297 --> 00:00:44,527
(Leonard(on screen):)to say how high school
prepares you

12
00:00:44,532 --> 00:00:47,462
(Leonard(on screen):)and what a wonderful
place it is,

13
00:00:47,468 --> 00:00:49,898
(Leonard(on screen):)but I hated it.

14
00:00:49,904 --> 00:00:52,474
(Leonard(on screen):)Maybe high school's great
if you look like this...

15
00:00:54,608 --> 00:00:59,548
(Leonard(on screen):)...but I didn't even feel like
I existed at that school.

